Magic traps suck, especially rust traps and polymorph traps. Aside from
having the searching intrinsic (ring of searching, excalibur, level 9
monk, level 10 archeologist/rogue/tourist, or level 1 ranger) how does
one avoid magic traps? I know that certain traps can only appear below
certain levels, but other than that, are there any ways to
avoid/foresee magic traps? And levitation doesn't protect you from
magic traps, right?

I'm aware that wearing an amulet of unchanging and a ring of polymorph
control can protect you from the effects of a polymorph trap, and
rustproofing your armor and weapon can protect you from the effects of
a rust trap, but there are some magic traps whose effects you can't
protect yourself from, and I'd like to know how to avoid/foresee magic
traps, specifically. 

Tips regarding non-magic traps are welcome too.



